# Workspace metadata files OpenClaw regenerates at the repo root. Anchored with `/`:
# unanchored, they also matched the tracked copies under agent-templates/, so a new
# template's SOUL.md or TOOLS.md was silently left out by `git add`.
/HEARTBEAT.md
/IDENTITY.md
/SOUL.md
/TOOLS.md
